      "chunk_index": 0,
      "content": "NovaTech（诺瓦科技）费用报销制度\n\n> 本文是 DX-RAG 项目原创、可公开分发的合成评估材料。NovaTech（诺瓦科技）为虚构组织，以下内容不代表真实公司的政策。",
      "metadata": {
        "collection_name": "t2001-novatech-pilot-01",
        "file_name": "expense_policy.md",
        "source_file": "uploads/t2001-novatech-pilot-01/expense_policy.md",
        "file_id": "09917d50-a3fd-44ae-9607-541d18d32658",
        "ingestion_status": "SUCCESS",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "chunk_id": "ea76f783-595b-4535-89ae-748258020c85",
        "file_size": 6215,
        "upload_time": "2026-09-09T13:06:27.076028+00:00"
